{"ID":"20240308150934-v8ctw96","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240308150934-v8ctw96","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240308150934-v8ctw96\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164732-05fwgi6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164732-ava6nm3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:39,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312164732-ava6nm3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:111,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:111\u0026#125;","title":"【桂枝加芍药汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312164732-05fwgi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-05fwgi6","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百九十三条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-96dmauc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-96dmauc","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：本「太阳病」，医反下之，因而腹满时痛者，属「太阴」也，「桂枝加芍药汤」主之；大实痛者，「桂枝加大黄汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-65l81q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-65l81q1","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本来是太阳证，医生该解表，结果没有解表攻下。攻下了以后，出现了因而腹满时痛者的症状，这是太阴证。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-amy4vu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-amy4vu2","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“大实痛者，「桂枝加大黄汤」主之”这个实痛是一阵一阵。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-9gkt05g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-9gkt05g","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳篇有建中汤，小建中汤。这边是桂枝加芍药汤，他不写小建中汤，桂枝重用芍药，桂枝重用芍药再加饴糖就是小建中汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里只加重芍药，所以这里看出来，白芍专门治痛，痛的原因是肚子里面有寒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，寒水累积在里面，所以静脉血液循环不好。女孩子月经痛也可以用白芍。肠子痛也可以用白芍。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-htapcts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-htapcts","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹痛，隐隐作痛，一阵一阵的痛。桂枝重用白芍。大实痛拒按，很强烈的痛，桂枝汤加大黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-bk4g3yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-bk4g3yq","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝加芍药汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-1lrhg2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-1lrhg2i","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两。芍药六两。甘草二两炙。生姜三两切。大枣十二枚擘。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-5uzroln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-5uzroln","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水七升，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-ay79w9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-ay79w9c","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三钱、芍药六钱、甘草两钱、生姜三片，红枣切。七碗水煮三碗水。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-wemz6if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-wemz6if","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甜味的东西会生湿，本来是湿就不要加饴糖"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-rj1d3z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-rj1d3z8","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临床治血癌，血癌是太阴症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。小孩子得到血癌就是打小儿麻痹疫苗，小儿麻痹疫苗的后遗症，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脑瘤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。而且很奇怪，现在美国制造出来的是沙滨疫苗，是口服的沙滨疫苗，所以我们临床看到小孩子几岁就得到脑瘤，什么血癌，问他你的小儿麻痹疫苗是什么，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"口服的沙滨疫苗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以千万不要去口服沙宾疫苗。大家放心，小儿麻痹，是可以治的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-r2xkhys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-r2xkhys","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用桂枝汤重用芍药，他脾湿肚子很胀，然后加生附子，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子两钱，大人五钱六钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，重用，因为里寒很盛，手脚是冰冷的。他肚子胀，口不渴，晚上睡觉非常冷，里寒盛，胃口也不好，这个处方里我加了白术 茯苓，利湿。生附子，里寒湿一去掉，阳恢复就好了。怎么知道他好了，本来不能睡的可以睡了，不能吃的可以吃了，大小便不好的，正常了，手脚本来冰冷然后热起来了。背后第五椎压痛是诊断血癌的，第五椎按下不痛了，好了。很多方法可以诊断。"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-tesymbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-tesymbd","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝加大黄汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-50m4o1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-50m4o1j","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两。芍药三两。甘草二两炙。生姜三两切。大枣十二枚擘。大黄一两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-ro683hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-ro683hd","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味，以水七升，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312164732-ava6nm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312164732-ava6nm3","updated":"20240312164732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三，大黄一，因为是在脾脏阴脏里面，脾湿很盛，这时候攻下不要给他四两，如果阳明证可以四两（四钱），桂枝三两。芍药三两。大黄一。微下就可以了，大黄不要太重，他拒按，有燥矢在里面，又腹满，肚子很胀，桂枝汤加一点大黄就可以了。"}]}]}